      "writtenOn": "2024-07-15T21:28:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the problem is dawn only validates the `minStorageBufferOffsetAlignment` against offset: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BindGroup.cpp;l\u003d114?q\u003dbindgroup.cpp\u0026ss\u003dchromium\n\nGL language indicates this required alignment also applies to buffer size:\n*\"GL_SHADER_STORAGE_BUFFER_OFFSET_ALIGNMENT\ndata returns a single value, the minimum required alignment for shader storage buffer sizes and offset.\"*\nhttps://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL-Refpages/es3/html/glGet.xhtml\n\nDo we need to propose a new limit like `minStorageBufferSizeAlignment` for compat then?",
      "parentUuid": "085a9c75_381b1c7d",
      "revId": "8285e653643c98729ac3541435161efac4236156",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b381ff09_51b8cbd8",
