      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-15T23:19:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well turns out on my local Pixel 8 the `minStorageBufferOffsetAlignment` is 256.\nSo I still don\u0027t know the exact reason why making the storage buffer size from 12 -\u003e 16 bytes make it pass on android ARM",
      "parentUuid": "df388396_36c2a759",
      "revId": "8285e653643c98729ac3541435161efac4236156",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
