      "side": 1,
      "message": "Recording purpose: as discussed in the meeting, there seems to be no restriction for buffer size. See *\"Table 6.5: Indexed buffer object limits and binding queries\"* in OpenGL ES 3.1 spec: https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/specs/es/3.1/es_spec_3.1.withchanges.pdf",
