      "writtenOn": "2024-07-16T22:15:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suspect the failure is due to std430 vec3 layout issue, it is same as vec4. But our buffer is still size of 3*sizeof(uint32_t)\u003d12.\n```\n/* Dumped generated GLSL */\n#version 320 es\nlayout(binding \u003d 0, std430) buffer tint_symbol_block_ssbo {\n   uvec3 inner;\n   uint pad;\n} tint_symbol;\n```\n\n*If any active shader storage block is not\nbacked by a sufficiently large buffer object, the results of shader execution may be\nundefined or modified, as described in section 6.4*",
      "parentUuid": "f5364ffe_71910e21",
